<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b55647f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-93ecf38 " data-id="b55647f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="b55647f">
    		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-82ca1e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="82ca1e3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Latest News</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60ccc02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="60ccc02" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<ul><li>09/29/2026, <strong>Important note:</strong> Doctoral Consortium (DC) was moved to <span style="color: red;">June 8, 2027</span>. Please note that attendance at DC is limited to selected students, DC organizers, and student mentors.</li><li>09/27/2026, the <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/registration-and-attendance-policies/#registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener">registration</a>, <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/registration-and-attendance-policies/#attendance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">attendance</a>, and <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/registration-and-attendance-policies/#refund" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cancellation and refund policies</a> are available.</li><li>09/26/2026, Explore the <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/interactive-map/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">interactive map</a> to discover what’s near our venue.</li><li>09/23/2026, UMAP 2027 has <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/student-funding-support/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">funding</a> to support student participants!</li><li>09/20/2026, <a href="https://um.org/umap2027/proceedings-and-acm-open-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subsidized APC Rates</a> for ACM&#8217;s Open Access publishing is available.</li></ul>								</div>
		
</div>

