  <div class="umap-schedule-row">
    <div class="umap-schedule-card">
      <h4><a href="https://um.org/umap2027/call-for-full-and-short-paper/" target="_blank">Full/Short Papers</a></h4>
      <p><strong>Abstract Submission:</strong> January 22, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Paper Submission:</strong> January 29, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Rebuttal Phase:</strong> March 2-8, 2027</p>
