      <p><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> December 11, 2026</p>
      <p><strong>Notification Date:</strong> January 15, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Camera-Ready Due:</strong> April 28, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Workshop Website and CFP Release Due:</strong> February 5, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Workshop/Tutorial Day:</strong> June 9, 2027</p>
    </div>
    <div class="umap-schedule-card">
      <h4><a href="https://um.org/umap2027/call-for-doctoral-consortium-submissions/" target="_blank">Doctoral Consortium</a></h4>
      <p><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> February 6, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Notification Date:</strong> February 20, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Camera-Ready Due:</strong> April 2, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Doctoral Consortium Day:</strong><font color="red"> June 8, 2027</font></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="umap-schedule-row">
    <div class="umap-schedule-card">
      <h4><a href="https://um.org/umap2027/call-for-industry-papers/" target="_blank">Industry Track</a></h4>
      <p><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> March 22, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Notification Date:</strong> April 22, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Camera-Ready Due:</strong> April 28, 2027</p>
    </div>
    <div class="umap-schedule-card">
      <h4><a href="https://um.org/umap2027/call-for-late-breaking-results-lbr-demos/" target="_blank">LBR &amp; Demos</a></h4>
      <p><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> March 22, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Notification Date:</strong> April 22, 2027</p>
      <p><strong>Camera-Ready Due:</strong> April 28, 2027</p>
    </div>
